<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article article-type="correction" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">J Cell Biol</journal-id><journal-title>The Journal of Cell Biology</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0021-9525</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1540-8140</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Rockefeller University Press</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2132849</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Correction</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Correction</article-title></title-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><day>19</day><month>10</month><year>1998</year></pub-date><volume>143</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>561</fpage><lpage>561</lpage><copyright-year>1998</copyright-year><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="142" page="1023" id="N0x38fdeb0N0x3f696a0" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="9722614" ext-link-type="pubmed"/></article-meta></front><body><p> Karki et al. Vol. 142, No. 4, August 24, 1998. Pages 1023&#x02013;1034.Two errors in the reported sequence of p22 were identified and corrected (see update to GenBank/ EMBL/DDBJ sequence <ext-link ext-link-type="gen" xlink:href="AF082513">AF082513</ext-link>). The corrected sequence and the corresponding changes in the  predicted secondary structure of p22 are shown below, replacing Fig. 1, <italic>b</italic> and <italic>c</italic> in the above-mentioned article. This change does not affect the results or interpretation of the other data presented  in this paper.</p><fig id="N0x38fdeb0N0x3f6e5e0" position="anchor"><graphic xlink:href="JCB14320.f1bc"/></fig></body></article>